Ok, I think you were on the right track.  First of all, NEVER touch a
cockatrice corpse unless you are wearing gloves.  For someone who has not
ascended, I would not even recommend thinking about touching a cockatrice.
Instead, you could have avoided most of your problems this way...

    When you got to the castle, you said that you drove the lich to another
level.  If this is the case, your problem is solved.  On the castle level,
in one of the corner rooms, there should be a chest with a wand inside.
This is a guaranteed wand of wishing.  If you did not have a scroll of
charging, you could wish for 2 blessed scrolls of charging.  Then I would
wish for a blessed magic marker.  Since you have not identified genocide,
you cannot write it unless you are a wizard(well at least not with a good
chance).  I would write identify scrolls and identify all your unknown
scrolls.
    If you find that you have genocide, bless the scroll and wipe out
liches("L")...PERIOD.  If you do not, depending on how many wishes you have,
you may want to wish for 2 blessed scrolls of genocide.  This will identify
the scroll type, plus give you a few to start with.  After that, write more
genocide scrolls as you need them.  If you are not a dwarf, I would suggest
genociding h to get mind flayers(";" would be a good idea too).  Use your
other scroll of charging from your first wish and recharge that wand when it
runs dry.  Write genocide and enchant armor/weapon scrolls until you pass
out from tedium.
    Don't forget to wish for some dragon scale armor before your read your
enchant armor scrolls.  It sounds like you couldn't get your hands on any.
Oh yeah, wish for some gauntlets(power,dexterity) too, so the "cockatrice
incident" won't come up again.  The bottom line is that if your equipment is
lacking, use and abuse that wishing wand to give you the upper hand.  Deck
yourself out in the best equipment.  Enchant everything you have.  Genocide
anything that looks at you funny (I still giggle like a school girl
everytime I read a genocide scroll).  That wand should give you a really
good chance of ascending.  Good luck.
